@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBorderColor #64748B
title 商品生命周期与终态约束
hide empty description
state "草稿" as Draft
state "待审核" as Pending
state "已发布" as Published
state "已预约" as Reserved
state "已确认" as Confirmed
state "已完成" as Completed
state "已下架" as Offline
[*] --> Draft : 卖家创建
Draft --> Pending : 完整提交
Pending --> Draft : 管理员驳回\n写明原因
Pending --> Published : 审核通过
Published --> Pending : 卖家修改\n无有效预约
Published --> Offline : 卖家主动下架
Published --> Reserved : 非本人买家预约\n建立唯一有效预约
Reserved --> Published : 买家取消/卖家拒绝\n预约变为终态
Reserved --> Confirmed : 对应卖家确认
Confirmed --> Completed : 对应买家确认完成
Confirmed --> Offline : 管理员批准异常关闭\n预约同步关闭
Reserved --> Offline : 管理员违规处置\n预约同步关闭
Published --> Offline : 管理员违规处置
Pending --> Offline : 管理员违规处置
Draft --> Offline : 管理员违规处置
Offline --> Pending : 卖家重新提交
Completed --> Completed : 追加违规处置记录\n保持成交事实
note right of Completed
禁止重新预约、回退或物理删除。
下架先成功则后续完成失败；
完成先成功则处置仅追加记录。
end note
note bottom of Reserved
商品已预约 ⇔ 预约待卖家确认
商品已确认 ⇔ 预约卖家已确认
取消/拒绝/关闭/完成预约不恢复有效。
end note
@enduml
